{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_4000_situation", "source_sha256": "61e35b7b9c065f87cdaac5bc68d772b9b3739d1c345924f80871f6b199ad6017", "ja": "遊園地リポートのお仕事", "zh": "游乐园报导的工作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_4000_place", "source_sha256": "3049bd9429cb91d0cec7ee49a32c3e03ffd1aff5d93eb4f41f01b0ac001b4436", "ja": "遊園地", "zh": "游乐园", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_4001_014mir", "source_sha256": "d3cc385d6c838ae056554cdbe9568d5647cfe2062cc4be8ca1abe538bc568fb5", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nなんだか、すっごく楽しそうな遊園地ですね♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n这座游乐园看起来非常有趣呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_4002_p", "source_sha256": "f0c73258b3dda37108ccd6cdde476ea6e7b34e8f4e77172f71eafb1e2160f094", "ja": "見た目は古いが、歴史のあるテーマパークだからな。\nところで、この後の流れは覚えてるか？　未来。", "zh": "虽然外表有点老旧，但毕竟是座有历史的主题乐园。\n话说回来，你记得接下来的流程吗？未来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_4003_014mir", "source_sha256": "aa436b746b4a500080bef48471ce4a64fa45660ca0cbbcb15be8f69d63cd42aa", "ja": "はいっ！　私の好きなアトラクションを、\n自由にリポートしていいんですよね♪", "zh": "是的！可以自由报导\n我喜欢的游乐设施对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_4004_014mir", "source_sha256": "e6a6ad8fec55ff6a3479e5ffe1d84f1e4cf61de1d9ff22a48e22e8e96e74ffdb", "ja": "じゃあじゃあ、私、あの観覧車乗りたいです♪\nあ、でもジェットコースターにも乗りたいし……。", "zh": "那样的话～我想搭那个摩天轮♪\n啊，可是我也搭云霄飞车……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_4005_014mir", "source_sha256": "f1619d316ac9cf5ccf0741339500d3ec51cc710621749566a2eda2a2f97cbba0", "ja": "どれも楽しそうで迷うなぁ……そうだ！\n{$P$}さんが決めてください！", "zh": "这两种看起来都很有趣，好难选喔……对了！\n请{$P$}先生帮我决定！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_4006_p", "source_sha256": "a98bc56a08b5f27dd7a705aeb7fea8d139d27a1d03c6d1177635403201e3f4a7", "ja": "俺がか？　それじゃあ……。", "zh": "我吗？那么就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_4007", "source_sha256": "266dff8b48bf1438be2fe65b5a8c910c08676bfe8eb0691e468359416e21d68c", "ja": "築40年の木製\nジェットコースター", "zh": "40年历史的\n木造云霄飞车", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_4008", "source_sha256": "ac013c5bfdfd682f2332f869dd476baf9abf1ab5587cf568d47543f03eb75c10", "ja": "丘の上の古い観覧車", "zh": "山丘上的老旧摩天轮", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_4009", "source_sha256": "09424619d4de1b71c175c90eb5703d1791207d1cca1f1562aaecb9f5537a3126", "ja": "いかにも出そうな\n隅っこのお化け屋敷", "zh": "看起来就像有鬼的\n偏僻鬼屋", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_4100_p", "source_sha256": "5e247424c6a01b6e6b2931c703a8c6546d69c02523af596f059f8c4386b5ad4a", "ja": "やっぱり、ジェットコースターでいこう！", "zh": "果然还是选云霄飞车吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_4101_014mir", "source_sha256": "32158e1fc961e7088e169ee06108951e6494bb2cd4772638807da085dab2f1ad", "ja": "ジェットコースター、いっちゃいますか！？\nハラハラする絶叫リポート、期待しててくださいね！", "zh": "要搭云霄飞车吗！？\n请好好期待我让人惊声尖叫的战栗报导喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_4102_p", "source_sha256": "026bdfa93097a46cb8a32017671989ea2ccb93e70a73a753e0ee2e890ed4b800", "ja": "おかえり、未来。\n木製ジェットコースターはどうだった？", "zh": "欢迎回来，未来。\n木造的云霄飞车搭起来如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_4103_014mir", "source_sha256": "ad65a9cc6252aeb71c9bef52298f38005040341bd0709d7a179046fa9e3ec830", "ja": "{$P$}さん、見てましたか！？\nあのコースター、一瞬浮いたんですよ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你有看到吗！？\n那个云霄飞车有一瞬间飘起来了耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_4104_014mir", "source_sha256": "708fd25c788e6fe0a1bd40c76120f49c19887ec45c01c479c92759dc30aaad55", "ja": "どんな仕掛けなのかな～？\n{$P$}さん、一緒に乗ってください！", "zh": "不晓得那是什么机关～？\n{$P$}先生，请和我一起去搭吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_4200_p", "source_sha256": "a4b3637a9361f03cca5c16451c8cbcee575449586d4b44ac9ae45fd8858a1ce3", "ja": "観覧車かな。眺めが良さそうだし。", "zh": "摩天轮吧，感觉视野很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_4201_014mir", "source_sha256": "fab523d109c0be97325fd92c56d4b0ed9799f337f95224b1f33463a3c60d36b8", "ja": "さすが{$P$}さん、わかってますね！\nそれじゃ、観覧車いってきまーす♪", "zh": "真不愧是{$P$}先生，很懂呢！\n那么，我去搭摩天轮了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_4202_p", "source_sha256": "a44e53819534bfe346642c9a8c676c4229145d4f3f886922b14a44ac8fdad65e", "ja": "おかえり、未来。観覧車はどうだった？", "zh": "欢迎回来，未来。摩天轮感觉如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_4203_014mir", "source_sha256": "31a1d2f79b3e2ecde318362e9862757bf447d862c29f5cbe880956d9b871fc54", "ja": "はい！　一番高いところで急に止まったり、\n風でグラグラしたりして、なんか楽しかったです♪", "zh": "是的！它转到最高的地方突然停了下来，\n还被风吹得摇摇晃晃的，好有趣呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_4300_p", "source_sha256": "7494e1a9d8e981d69def7ae8bc89c629534a4965c29391df5a49dd9c2340a58f", "ja": "お化け屋敷だな！", "zh": "就选鬼屋吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_4301_014mir", "source_sha256": "63d895d9affd870dadf1ea3b1e0791b371e85a000c74e8f00cf1bcf0c72e538a", "ja": "お化け屋敷ですね、わかりました！\nうう、あんまり怖くないといいなぁ……あれっ？", "zh": "鬼屋是吗，我知道了！\n呜呜，希望不会太可怕……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_4302_p", "source_sha256": "239e9e4af8d19ed0775d3f150ef5302643dd513732c1d57a988e171f4263d785", "ja": "どうした？　未来。", "zh": "怎么了？未来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_4303_014mir", "source_sha256": "e49dc8da96d8037d39fbca8e44f6ed4fce651d840a4ba5474d6396c7c706bdd0", "ja": "{$P$}さん……こ、ここ……。\n遊園地の事務所って、書いてあります……！！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……这、这里……\n上头写着游乐园的事务所……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
